 {
  "id": "E1",
  "title": "E2 omitted-interaction bound: H_R - B_O <= H <= H_R + B_O verified in exact rational arithmetic (6000 state/fraction checks); the C++ certified B_O is >= the exact omitted weight (outward rounded); retained set and its ordering digest equal an independent re-implementation; mixed-sign, zero-coupling and all-degenerate instances included",
  "evidence_level": "PROOF_PLUS_EXACT_ARITHMETIC",
  "status": "PASS",
  "mandatory": true,
  "detail": {
   "inequality_checks": 6000,
   "mismatches": [],
   "proof": "For every state s, |H_O(s)| = |sum_{(i,j) in O} K_ij s_i s_j| <= sum_O |K_ij| = B_O (triangle inequality, |s_i s_j| = 1), hence H_R - B_O <= H = H_R + H_O <= H_R + B_O. Rejecting a state needs H_R - B_O - eps > Ecut, accepting needs H_R + B_O + eps <= Ecut; eps (= eps_gray) bounds the rounding of the incrementally maintained H_R, so no actual target can be rejected and no non-target accepted."
  }
 },
